      "card_ids": ["C06"],
      "claim": "Compound 6 showed low baseline brain uptake in rats that dramatically increased after cyclosporin A pretreatment, indicating efflux-mediated BBB exclusion and poor CNS access.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    }
  ],
  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "All transferred in-vivo records consistently show poor BBB penetration, low CSF/plasma ratios, and efflux-mediated exclusion; therefore meaningful CNS access is not supported.",
